  "description": "Official Deepgram API on INPUT input → OUTPUT output. transcribe = POST /v1/listen (pre-recorded HTTP). speak = POST /v1/speak. listen = live WebSocket ingress (no socket). Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Authorization Token. speak audio on OUTPUT is type file. Docs: https://developers.deepgram.com/reference/speech-to-text/listen-pre-recorded. Terms: https://deepgram.com/terms. Never log api_key.",
